        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover a Cursed World of Mystery and Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as Ruby in a shadowy realm where ancient portals hide dark secrets. Your mother vanished long ago. Now fragmented memories lead you beneath the fortress of Vianden into worlds twisted by witchcraft. Face hooded cultists casting spells. Battle skeletons rising from the ground. Dodge possessed birds in the gloom. Collect glowing XP orbs from defeated foes to grow stronger, and purchase upgrades from your ol' pal, Skully the barman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/8dbab4e6e2a02a46b05a5675be9b057d.poster.avif?t=1782921836\" width=1420 height=796 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/8dbab4e6e2a02a46b05a5675be9b057d.webm?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/8dbab4e6e2a02a46b05a5675be9b057d.mp4?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay That Hooks You In</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-built levels packed with puzzles and perils. Leap platforms, blast enemies with magic flames, and discover secrets. Each realm brings fresh challenges. Green swamps ooze with toxic sludge. Orange factories rumble with crushers and blades. Blue depths demand swimming through hidden caves. Pink alien zones twist with bizarre life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/b1876b6e1daa35244ec7c49c35eec026.poster.avif?t=1782921836\" width=1416 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/b1876b6e1daa35244ec7c49c35eec026.webm?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/b1876b6e1daa35244ec7c49c35eec026.mp4?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Allies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather upgrade points from blue orbs dropped by enemies or hidden sacks. Spend them at Skully's shop. This skeleton bartender becomes your buddy. He pops up on screens with tips and upgrades like extra health or faster shots. Level up to tackle tougher spots. Feel Ruby grow from lost explorer to realm-shaking force.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom upgrades fit your playstyle. Go for speed, agility or raw power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly skeletons add light moments in the dark world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels for missed collectibles. Chase full completion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/66fd8bb9f9dea468b0af044ca28b08ac.poster.avif?t=1782921836\" width=1426 height=794 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/66fd8bb9f9dea468b0af044ca28b08ac.webm?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/66fd8bb9f9dea468b0af044ca28b08ac.mp4?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Dive Into Ruby's Realms?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This indie gem mixes metroidvania exploration with puzzle platforming. Short levels keep the pace snappy. The story pulls you in with family ties and twists. Pixel art shines in moody realms. Soundtrack swells with mystery. Perfect for quick sessions or deep dives. Join Ruby's quest. Wishlist today and step through the portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover a Cursed World of Mystery and Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as Ruby in a shadowy realm where ancient portals hide dark secrets. Your mother vanished long ago. Now fragmented memories lead you beneath the fortress of Vianden into worlds twisted by witchcraft. Face hooded cultists casting spells. Battle skeletons rising from the ground. Dodge possessed birds in the gloom. Collect glowing XP orbs from defeated foes to grow stronger, and purchase upgrades from your ol' pal, Skully the barman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/8dbab4e6e2a02a46b05a5675be9b057d.poster.avif?t=1782921836\" width=1420 height=796 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/8dbab4e6e2a02a46b05a5675be9b057d.webm?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/8dbab4e6e2a02a46b05a5675be9b057d.mp4?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay That Hooks You In</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-built levels packed with puzzles and perils. Leap platforms, blast enemies with magic flames, and discover secrets. Each realm brings fresh challenges. Green swamps ooze with toxic sludge. Orange factories rumble with crushers and blades. Blue depths demand swimming through hidden caves. Pink alien zones twist with bizarre life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/b1876b6e1daa35244ec7c49c35eec026.poster.avif?t=1782921836\" width=1416 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/b1876b6e1daa35244ec7c49c35eec026.webm?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/b1876b6e1daa35244ec7c49c35eec026.mp4?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Allies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather upgrade points from blue orbs dropped by enemies or hidden sacks. Spend them at Skully's shop. This skeleton bartender becomes your buddy. He pops up on screens with tips and upgrades like extra health or faster shots. Level up to tackle tougher spots. Feel Ruby grow from lost explorer to realm-shaking force.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom upgrades fit your playstyle. Go for speed, agility or raw power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly skeletons add light moments in the dark world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels for missed collectibles. Chase full completion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/66fd8bb9f9dea468b0af044ca28b08ac.poster.avif?t=1782921836\" width=1426 height=794 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/66fd8bb9f9dea468b0af044ca28b08ac.webm?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861720/extras/66fd8bb9f9dea468b0af044ca28b08ac.mp4?t=1782921836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Dive Into Ruby's Realms?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This indie gem mixes metroidvania exploration with puzzle platforming. Short levels keep the pace snappy. The story pulls you in with family ties and twists. Pixel art shines in moody realms. Soundtrack swells with mystery. Perfect for quick sessions or deep dives. Join Ruby's quest. Wishlist today and step through the portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
